{"publicId":"e93055f3-f452-40bd-bbd7-d99ab28a6bd8","title":"人类线粒体蛋白质互作预测及数据库开放","status":"settled","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-06T19:20:01.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-06T19:20:01.000Z","digest":"德州农工大学团队利用AI工具AlphaFold-Multimer预测了人类线粒体1,100种蛋白质的2,895种潜在互作关系，并通过实验室验证部分预测结果【新】。该研究首次系统性构建线粒体蛋白质互作图谱，传统方法因实验成本高难以覆盖所有互作，而AI预测显著降低研究门槛。研究开放在线数据库MitoMatch供全球研究者使用，发表在《Nature Communications》【新】。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-07T14:58:47.514Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"德州农工大学AgriLife研究团队在 Nature Communications 发表线粒体蛋白质互作预测研究","latestReport":{"id":"iqt9hpneb7rbv1pgrlns5vxkq"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fqPNjNxWlAcs","title":"The predicted interactome of the human mitochondrial proteom","firstReportAt":"2026-11-06T19:20:01.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"iqt9hpneb7rbv1pgrlns5vxkq","title":"德州农工大学AgriLife研究团队在 Nature Communications 发表线粒体蛋白质互作预测研究","summary":"德州农工大学AgriLife研究团队利用AI工具AlphaFold-Multimer预测了线粒体内1,100种蛋白质的2,895种潜在互作关系。实验室验证了其中部分预测结果，并开放了在线数据库MitoMatch供全球研究者使用。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-06T19:20:01.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"iqt9hpneb7rbv1pgrlns5vxkq","title":"德州农工大学AgriLife研究团队在 Nature Communications 发表线粒体蛋白质互作预测研究","summary":"德州农工大学AgriLife研究团队利用AI工具AlphaFold-Multimer预测了线粒体内1,100种蛋白质的2,895种潜在互作关系。实验室验证了其中部分预测结果，并开放了在线数据库MitoMatch供全球研究者使用。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-06T19:20:01.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-07T15:00:00.000Z","heat":5.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T16:00:00.000Z","heat":5.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T17:00:00.000Z","heat":5.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T18:00:00.000Z","heat":5.2,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T19:00:00.000Z","heat":5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-07T20:00:00.000Z","heat":4.9,"participant